WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.900
True short-term rental performance is driven by spatial beauty, bespoke finishes, and hospitality provenance. Yet traditional real estate underwriting treats million-dollar architectural cabins like generic single-family rentals.

2
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:25.200
PencilSTR bridges architectural distinction with rigorous credit underwriting. Our autonomous radar uncovers unheralded gems across top destination markets, pairing imagery with verified revenue comps.

3
00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:38.750
